304 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 141 0 R
/E (The GRL-DANN model achieves highly reliable seizure prediction with strong cross-patient generalization. The confusion matrix shows very few false positives \(6\) and false negatives \(2\), indicating high sensitivity and low false alarm rate. The ROC curve reaches an AUC of 0.9971, demonstrating near-perfect class separation. Training loss decreases steadily, and validation AUC improves to around 0.99, confirming stable learning and effective domain adaptation. Overall, GRL provides robust and clinically reliable seizure detection.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
