<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 143 0 R
/E (CNN-LSTM and GRL show the best overall performance with 97% accuracy and very high F1-scores \(0.96\). CNN-LSTM achieves the highest recall \(0.99\), meaning it detects almost all seizures. GRL performs nearly as well \(0.96 recall\) while improving generalization through domain adaptation.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
325 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
